# 4-2 冪等性（Idempotency-Key）
# 同時送信のデモは npm run idempotency、outbox は make relay

@api = {{$dotenv API_BASE_URL}}
@sb = {{$dotenv SUPABASE_URL}}
@anon = {{$dotenv SUPABASE_ANON_KEY}}
@pw = {{$dotenv DEMO_PASSWORD}}

### ログイン（alice）
# @name alice
POST {{sb}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "alice@example.com", "password": "{{pw}}"}

### 1 回目：201 Created
POST {{api}}/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-4-2-0001

{"items": [{"sku": "SKU-000020", "quantity": 1}]}

### 2 回目（同じキー・同じ内容）：保存済みレスポンスを再生（Idempotent-Replayed: true、同じ id）
POST {{api}}/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-4-2-0001

{"items": [{"sku": "SKU-000020", "quantity": 1}]}

### 同じキーで内容を改ざん：422
POST {{api}}/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-4-2-0001

{"items": [{"sku": "SKU-000020", "quantity": 99}]}

### キーなし：送るたびに別の注文が作られる（二重注文のリスク）
POST {{api}}/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"sku": "SKU-000020", "quantity": 1}]}
